    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 35 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52) (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) and the legal effect of the section as amended is toexpand the provisions to arrest the offenders without a warrant.",
