  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      255.65,
      401.89,
      279.95
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      294.65,
      401.87,
      318.95
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Excise (Amendment)Act, No. of 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      333.65,
      401.92,
      409.91
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 35 of the Excise Ordinance (Chapter 52)(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended in subsection (1) thereof by the substitution forthe words and figures, \u201csection 46 or section 47;\u201d of thewords and figures, \u201csection 46, section 47 or paragraph (a)of section 48;\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      424.61,
      401.88,
      448.91
    ],
    "text": "3.Section 52 of the principal enactment is herebyamended in subsection (1) thereof as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      179.13,
      463.61,
      401.87,
      487.91
    ],
    "text": "(1) by the repeal of paragraph (a) thereof and thesubstitution therefor of the following:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      198.09,
      502.61,
      401.88,
      552.95
    ],
    "text": "\u201c(a) under section 46, section 47 or paragraph (a)of section 48, except on his own knowledge orsuspicion or on the complaint or report of anexcise officer or a police officer:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      216.81,
      567.53,
      401.89,
      669.95
    ],
    "text": "Provided however, where a police officermakes a complaint or produces a report underparagraph (a) of section 48, such officer shallbe an officer not below the rank of a subinspector and shall obtain the written sanctionof the Commissioner-General of Excise or anyother officer authorised by the Commissioner-General of Excise;\u201d;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
